+# PredictionHook markets in the Uniswap web app (local fork)
+
+This is a shallow clone of `Uniswap/interface` at commit `9023421` (2026-09-23) with the changes below. It lets the stock swap
+form quote and trade the YES/NO outcome tokens of our PredictionHook markets on Unichain Sepolia (chain 1301). Every other
+token and chain still goes through Uniswap's hosted Trading API unchanged.
+
+The approach is "Strategy B" from `../docs/research/interface-fork/RECOMMENDATION.md`: the `TradingApiClient` singleton is
+wrapped, and requests for a USDC <-> YES/NO pair on 1301 are answered in the page. Quotes come from the official V4Quoter
+(`eth_call`); the transaction is `UniversalRouter 2.0.execute([PERMIT2_PERMIT,] V4_SWAP[swap, SETTLE_ALL, TAKE_ALL])`,
+built locally.
+
+Run it only on `http://localhost:3000`. It carries Uniswap branding and relies on Uniswap's dev gateway for everything that
+is not ours, and the gateway only accepts localhost origins.
+
+## 1. Run it locally
+
+Runtimes: bun `1.3.14` and node `22.22.2` exactly (`.bun-version`, `.nvmrc`; `engine-strict` is on). Nothing needs a
+global install. In this workspace both were unpacked into the session scratchpad, and every command ran with the
+scratchpad's `env.sh` (it prepends those binaries to `PATH` and points `HOME` and the bun cache into the scratchpad).
+
+```sh
+git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/Uniswap/interface interface
+cd interface
+
+# Local-run patches for the public mirror (already applied here; diff below)
+#   package.json   drop "tools/uniswap-nx" from "workspaces"
+#   nx.json        sync.globalGenerators = [], sync.disabledTaskSyncGenerators = ["@universe/uniswap-nx:tsconfig-sync"]
+#   tsconfig.json  drop references to tools/uniswap-nx, apps/cli, packages/transactional, apps/dev-portal, apps/mission-control
+printf 'WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID="walletconnect_project_id"\nPRIVY_APP_ID=""\nPRIVY_CLIENT_ID=""\n' > apps/web/.env.override
+
+bun install                        # ~22 s with a warm cache; rewrites bun.lock (missing workspaces dropped)
+SKIP_CONFIG_PULL=true bun web dev  # ready in ~5 s, serves http://localhost:3000
+```
+
+The first page load takes 30-40 s while Vite optimises dependencies. To stop the server, kill the `nx`, `vite`, `workerd`
+and `esbuild` processes.
+
