+Checked on 2026-09-26 with this fork:
+
+- `curl http://localhost:3000/` and `/swap?chain=unichain_sepolia` return 200 (`<title>Uniswap Interface</title>`).
+- A headless Chrome smoke test turned on testnet mode and opened
+  `/swap?chain=unichain_sepolia&inputCurrency=ETH&outputCurrency=0x31d0220469e10c4E71834a79b1f276d740d3768F`.
+  - The form showed ETH -> USDC with no token warning.
